{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022b.q15.material.recovered", "text": "现实生活中，教师有不同引出菱形概念的方法：【教师甲】让学生画出周长为12的平行四边形，要求各个边长为整数。学生在教师指导下，画出了边长分别为1和5、2和4、3和3的平行四边形，将第3个平行四边形与前面2个平行四边形进行对比，从而引出菱形的概念。【教师乙】让学生观察并概括以下生活中平行四边形图片的共性，从而引出菱形的概念。【教师丙】引导学生回顾小学学习的平行四边形、矩形等图形，请学生用一张B5的纸按下列步骤得到一个平行四边形，发现该平行四边形的特殊之处，由此引出菱形的概念。【教师丁】在学生学习了三角形、特殊三角形和平行四边形的基础之上，类比三角形到特殊三角形的研究过程，将平行四边形的边长之间的关系特殊化，从而得到等长的平行四边形，由此引出菱形的概念。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "664c5fbfa2d015e2d2312d2499da86a1fe79028c3c5d823b6096b0bb7224fbfe", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 742, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1070, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 15, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "664c5fbfa2d015e2d2312d2499da86a1fe79028c3c5d823b6096b0bb7224fbfe"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022b.q15"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.304.r011", "ntce.outline.304.r017", "ntce.outline.304.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022b.q15"], "word_count": 328, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "664c5fbfa2d015e2d2312d2499da86a1fe79028c3c5d823b6096b0bb7224fbfe", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 742, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1070, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment